{"seq":2,"slug":"drift-detection-reconciliation","title":"漂移检测与修复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/operations/drift-detection-reconciliation","wordCount":1071,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"漂移检测与修复\">漂移检测与修复</h1><p>基础设施漂移（Drift）是实际云资源状态与 IaC 代码/状态文件定义之间的偏差。漂移是不可避免的——紧急事故时的手动修复、自动伸缩策略的运行时调整、云平台的默认值变更都会制造偏差。关键不是消灭漂移的产生，而是建立系统性的检测机制和可控的修复流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>基础设施漂移</strong>：实际云资源状态与 IaC 代码/状态文件之间的偏差</li>\n<li><strong>三方偏差模型</strong>：配置文件、状态文件、云实际状态三者间的偏离关系</li>\n<li><strong>定时 Plan</strong>：周期性运行 <code>terraform plan -refresh-only</code> 检测外部变更</li>\n<li><strong>事件驱动检测</strong>：通过 CloudTrail/Activity Log 事件触发实时漂移检查</li>\n<li><strong>修复路径</strong>：代码适配现实（import）、强制回滚（apply）、状态手术（state mv/rm）</li>\n<li><strong>预防措施</strong>：限制控制台权限、强制标签策略、版本固定 Provider</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"漂移的三方偏差模型\">漂移的三方偏差模型</h2><p>漂移涉及三个&quot;真相源&quot;之间的偏差：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;.tf 配置文件&lt;br/&gt;(期望状态)&quot;] --- B[&quot;.tfstate 状态文件&lt;br/&gt;(上次已知状态)&quot;]&#10;    B --- C[&quot;云资源实际状态&lt;br/&gt;(真实现状)&quot;]&#10;    A --- C&#10;&#10;    D[&quot;配置-状态偏差&lt;br/&gt;代码变更未 apply&quot;] -.-&gt; A&#10;    D -.-&gt; B&#10;    E[&quot;状态-实际偏差&lt;br/&gt;外部变更(漂移)&quot;] -.-&gt; B&#10;    E -.-&gt; C&#10;    F[&quot;配置-实际偏差&lt;br/&gt;综合偏差&quot;] -.-&gt; A&#10;    F -.-&gt; C\">graph TD\n    A[\".tf 配置文件&lt;br/&gt;(期望状态)\"] --- B[\".tfstate 状态文件&lt;br/&gt;(上次已知状态)\"]\n    B --- C[\"云资源实际状态&lt;br/&gt;(真实现状)\"]\n    A --- C\n\n    D[\"配置-状态偏差&lt;br/&gt;代码变更未 apply\"] -.-&gt; A\n    D -.-&gt; B\n    E[\"状态-实际偏差&lt;br/&gt;外部变更(漂移)\"] -.-&gt; B\n    E -.-&gt; C\n    F[\"配置-实际偏差&lt;br/&gt;综合偏差\"] -.-&gt; A\n    F -.-&gt; C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>偏差类型</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>检测方式</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>配置→状态</td>\n<td>代码修改后未 apply</td>\n<td><code>tofu plan</code> 显示变更</td>\n<td>低（可控）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态→实际</td>\n<td>手动/外部变更</td>\n<td><code>tofu plan -refresh-only</code></td>\n<td>高（不可控）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置→实际</td>\n<td>以上两者叠加</td>\n<td><code>tofu plan</code>（综合显示）</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"漂移检测方法\">漂移检测方法</h2><h3 id=\"方法一-定时-plan-推荐起步\">方法一：定时 Plan（推荐起步）</h3><p>最简单的漂移检测——定时运行 <code>terraform plan</code> 并检查是否有意外变更：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 纯检测模式：刷新状态但不修改基础设施&#10;tofu plan -refresh-only -detailed-exitcode&#10;&#10;# 退出码语义：&#10;# 0 = 无变更（状态与实际一致）&#10;# 1 = 执行错误&#10;# 2 = 有变更（检测到漂移）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 纯检测模式：刷新状态但不修改基础设施</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tofu</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> plan</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -refresh-only</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -detailed-exitcode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 退出码语义：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 0 = 无变更（状态与实际一致）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1 = 执行错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2 = 有变更（检测到漂移）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 CI 中的自动化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Drift Detection&#10;on:&#10;  schedule:&#10;    - cron: &#39;0 6 * * *&#39; # 每日 UTC 06:00&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  detect-drift:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    strategy:&#10;      matrix:&#10;        workspace: [networking, compute, database, security]&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - name: Detect Drift&#10;        id: drift&#10;        run: |&#10;          tofu init&#10;          tofu plan -refresh-only -detailed-exitcode 2&gt;&amp;1 | tee plan-output.txt&#10;          echo &quot;exit_code=$?&quot; &gt;&gt; $GITHUB_OUTPUT&#10;        continue-on-error: true&#10;      - name: Alert on Drift&#10;        if: steps.drift.outputs.exit_code == &#39;2&#39;&#10;        run: |&#10;          # 发送告警到 Slack/PagerDuty&#10;          echo &quot;::warning::检测到 ${{ matrix.workspace }} 存在配置漂移&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Drift Detection</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  schedule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cron</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0 6 * * *'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 每日 UTC 06:00</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  detect-drift</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    strategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      matrix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        workspace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">compute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">security</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Detect Drift</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">drift</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          tofu init</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          tofu plan -refresh-only -detailed-exitcode 2>&#x26;1 | tee plan-output.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          echo \"exit_code=$?\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        continue-on-error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Alert on Drift</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">steps.drift.outputs.exit_code == '2'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          # 发送告警到 Slack/PagerDuty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          echo \"::warning::检测到 ${{ matrix.workspace }} 存在配置漂移\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方法二-事件驱动检测\">方法二：事件驱动检测</h3><p>利用云平台的变更事件流实时检测漂移：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>AWS CloudTrail</strong> → EventBridge → Lambda → 触发 plan</li>\n<li><strong>Azure Activity Log</strong> → Event Grid → Function → 触发 plan</li>\n<li><strong>GCP Audit Log</strong> → Pub/Sub → Cloud Function → 触发 plan</li>\n</ul>\n<p>事件驱动的优势是实时性——漂移产生后分钟级发现，而非等到下一次定时扫描。</p>\n<h3 id=\"方法三-平台级持续验证\">方法三：平台级持续验证</h3><p>Terraform Cloud（HCP Terraform）和 Spacelift 提供内置的持续漂移检测：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>检测频率</th>\n<th>修复方式</th>\n<th>通知方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HCP Terraform</td>\n<td>可配置（每小时~每日）</td>\n<td>手动或自动 apply</td>\n<td>Email / Webhook</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spacelift</td>\n<td>可配置 + 事件触发</td>\n<td>自动协调（可选）</td>\n<td>Slack / PagerDuty</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>env0</td>\n<td>定时</td>\n<td>手动审批 apply</td>\n<td>集成通知</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"漂移修复策略\">漂移修复策略</h2><p>检测到漂移后，有三种修复路径：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Decision = f(Severity, Intent, Reversibility)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ibi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[检测到漂移] --&gt; B{变更是否有意为之?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[更新 IaC 代码以匹配现实]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{变更是否安全相关?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[立即 apply 回滚到代码定义]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F{是否影响可用性?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[评估后手动决策]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[下次常规 apply 时回滚]&#10;    C --&gt; I[提交 PR + 审批]&#10;    E --&gt; J[紧急 apply + 事后补 PR]\">graph TD\n    A[检测到漂移] --&gt; B{变更是否有意为之?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[更新 IaC 代码以匹配现实]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{变更是否安全相关?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[立即 apply 回滚到代码定义]\n    D --&gt;|否| F{是否影响可用性?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[评估后手动决策]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[下次常规 apply 时回滚]\n    C --&gt; I[提交 PR + 审批]\n    E --&gt; J[紧急 apply + 事后补 PR]</pre><h3 id=\"路径一-代码适配现实-import-adopt\">路径一：代码适配现实（Import/Adopt）</h3><p>当手动变更是<em>有意且正确</em>的（如紧急扩容），将现实状态导入代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 方式 A：更新代码 + refresh state&#10;tofu apply -refresh-only  # 将状态更新为实际值&#10;# 然后修改 .tf 代码匹配&#10;&#10;# 方式 B：import 新发现的资源&#10;tofu import aws_instance.emergency_scale i-0abc123def456\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 方式 A：更新代码 + refresh state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tofu</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apply</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -refresh-only</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 将状态更新为实际值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 然后修改 .tf 代码匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 方式 B：import 新发现的资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tofu</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aws_instance.emergency_scale</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> i-0abc123def456</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"路径二-强制回滚到代码定义\">路径二：强制回滚到代码定义</h3><p>当手动变更是<em>未授权或有风险</em>的（如安全组被意外打开），强制恢复：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"tofu apply  # 将云资源恢复到代码定义的状态\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tofu</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apply</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 将云资源恢复到代码定义的状态</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"路径三-state-surgery-最后手段\">路径三：state surgery（最后手段）</h3><p>当状态文件与现实的映射关系损坏时：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 从状态中移除不再由 Terraform 管理的资源&#10;tofu state rm aws_instance.decommissioned&#10;&#10;# 重新关联资源到不同的状态键&#10;tofu state mv aws_instance.old aws_instance.new\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从状态中移除不再由 Terraform 管理的资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tofu</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aws_instance.decommissioned</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 重新关联资源到不同的状态键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tofu</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mv</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aws_instance.old</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aws_instance.new</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"预防漂移的结构性措施\">预防漂移的结构性措施</h2><p>最好的漂移修复是预防漂移发生：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>措施</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>限制控制台写权限</td>\n<td>IAM 策略：只读 + 条件写</td>\n<td>减少手动变更来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强制标签策略</td>\n<td>AWS SCP / Azure Policy</td>\n<td>非 IaC 创建的资源被拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更审批流程</td>\n<td>所有变更必须通过 PR</td>\n<td>消除直接 apply</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态锁定</td>\n<td>DynamoDB / 远程 backend 锁</td>\n<td>防止并发写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Provider 版本固定</td>\n<td><code>required_providers</code> 精确版本</td>\n<td>避免隐式默认值变更</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"漂移的分类与优先级\">漂移的分类与优先级</h2><p>不是所有漂移都需要立即修复。建立分类体系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分类</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>SLA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>安全漂移</td>\n<td>安全组规则被放宽</td>\n<td>P0</td>\n<td>1 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规漂移</td>\n<td>加密被关闭</td>\n<td>P1</td>\n<td>4 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本漂移</td>\n<td>实例被升级但未更新代码</td>\n<td>P2</td>\n<td>24 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>装饰性漂移</td>\n<td>标签不一致</td>\n<td>P3</td>\n<td>下次常规维护</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关于如何在变更前估算成本影响以减少成本漂移，参见 <a href=\"cost-estimation-testing\">成本预估与测试</a>。关于漂移检测管道的具体编排，参见 <a href=\"infra-test-in-pipeline\">CI/CD 中的基础设施测试</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>基础设施漂移不可避免，但可以系统性地检测和修复。定时 plan 是最简单的起步方案，事件驱动检测提供实时性，平台级持续验证提供规模化管理。修复时根据变更的意图、安全影响和可逆性选择路径——代码适配、强制回滚或状态手术。更根本的策略是通过限制手动变更权限和强制 IaC 工作流来从结构上减少漂移产生。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"漂移检测与修复","id":"漂移检测与修复"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"漂移的三方偏差模型","id":"漂移的三方偏差模型"},{"level":2,"text":"漂移检测方法","id":"漂移检测方法"},{"level":3,"text":"方法一：定时 Plan（推荐起步）","id":"方法一-定时-plan-推荐起步"},{"level":3,"text":"方法二：事件驱动检测","id":"方法二-事件驱动检测"},{"level":3,"text":"方法三：平台级持续验证","id":"方法三-平台级持续验证"},{"level":2,"text":"漂移修复策略","id":"漂移修复策略"},{"level":3,"text":"路径一：代码适配现实（Import/Adopt）","id":"路径一-代码适配现实-import-adopt"},{"level":3,"text":"路径二：强制回滚到代码定义","id":"路径二-强制回滚到代码定义"},{"level":3,"text":"路径三：state surgery（最后手段）","id":"路径三-state-surgery-最后手段"},{"level":2,"text":"预防漂移的结构性措施","id":"预防漂移的结构性措施"},{"level":2,"text":"漂移的分类与优先级","id":"漂移的分类与优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CI/CD 中的基础设施测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/operations/infra-test-in-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"成本预估与测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/operations/cost-estimation-testing"}}